Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,1030)}鷹原!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1342,1030)}羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1697,1030)}鷹原!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:09.56,0:00:14.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在水中格鬥  是供奉海神的儀式
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.34,0:00:19.58,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在重要時刻  島上的男人們便會向大海展示自己的決心
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.84,0:00:23.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你這小子若已下定決心  那就讓我見識見識吧!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.37,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小子!
Comment: 4,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN————————
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,1068)}羽依里!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,1068)}鷹原!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1342,1068)}羽依里!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.19,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1697,1068)}鷹原!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.56,0:00:14.34,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,水中格闘技は　海神様への奉納の儀
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.34,0:00:19.58,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,島の男たちは大事なとき　いつも海で　己の覚悟を示してきた
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.84,0:00:23.60,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,貴様にも覚悟があるのなら　示してみせろ
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.37,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小僧！
Comment: 5,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN  OP後————————
Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,1222,0,0,,一起做些力所能及的事吧
Dialogue: 5,0:02:13.48,0:02:15.48,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs80\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}小子  你就這點決心嗎!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.74,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,果然不行嗎…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.41,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我又…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.87,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs80\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}到此為止了!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.19,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs84\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}你連你外孫女獨自一人時
Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.88,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs84\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}露出什麼樣的表情都不知道!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.38,0:02:38.72,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里！加油!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.51,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.52,0:02:57.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,出界了…!?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,贏了…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里贏啦!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.51,0:03:24.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,十年前的夏天  她失去了父母
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.64,0:03:28.27,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,從那之後開始變得內向
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒有朋友  還被流言蜚語
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.12,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,夏天總是獨自一人…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我把白羽交給你了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.88,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,外公
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.91,0:03:41.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.47,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在夏鳥之儀期間  我會一直陪在白羽身邊
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.47,0:03:46.82,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,保護著白羽
Dialogue: 5,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這樣一來  那些流言便會消失了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.22,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.79,0:03:58.89,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,關於這個
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.33,0:04:04.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,夏鳥之儀期間能陪巫女的人  只能是親屬
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.36,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,親戚?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸——!?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.06,0:04:14.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不不不不… 不行的  那種事
Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.06,0:04:18.15,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,和羽依里結為  夫 夫 夫  夫妻這種事…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.28,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,當然了  這只是形式上的結為夫妻
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.49,0:04:28.32,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我很感謝白羽
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,感謝?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.14,0:04:33.25,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,所以  如果白羽遭遇了危險
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.94,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我想在第一時間幫助到她
Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.08,0:04:39.90,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,如果…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.28,0:04:40.78,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.04,0:04:43.78,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不嫌麻煩的話…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.40,0:04:44.90,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.73,0:04:47.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.35,0:04:54.16,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,請和我結為夫婦吧
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,好棒!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,姐姐和哥哥要結婚了!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.31,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,只是形式上的啦
Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.31,0:05:08.75,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,之後你還要準備「蝶番契約」之類的事
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.45,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,所以倉庫這邊不用幫忙了
Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.64,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,加油哦
Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.28,0:05:14.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,謝謝您
Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.34,0:05:17.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿~
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.01,0:05:18.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,夫妻
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.45,0:05:34.69,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在祭典當天  要將這些燈籠放入大海
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.69,0:05:36.77,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,到時候記得帶上哦
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,1200,0,0,,好~
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.17,0:05:42.44,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,333,0,,難道白羽說的海裡看到紅光  指的是燈籠嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.11,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,話說  蒼
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.03,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.03,0:05:47.85,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那孩子
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.85,0:05:50.82,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,啊… 那孩子名字叫堀田
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.54,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,去年冬天  她媽媽因為生病…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:00.17,0:06:00.98,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小堀田
Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.78,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你知道盂蘭盆節嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,盂蘭盆節時  死去的人會暫時回來
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.01,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,死去的人會回來?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.54,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.73,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,人是看不到的
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.16,0:06:27.79,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,然後在祭典當晚  它們會隨著放入大海的燈籠回去
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.52,0:06:30.18,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,黑暗很可怕對吧
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.89,0:06:32.81,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,很可怕
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.59,0:06:37.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,所以才會製作燈籠將大海照亮
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.90,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,能讓它們安心回去
Dialogue: 5,0:06:47.08,0:06:47.68,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.58,0:06:53.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒記錯的話  今天要試衣服吧
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.62,0:06:54.59,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽已經去試衣服了
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.40,0:07:02.29,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,據白羽的預知  祭典當天鷹原你們會溺水對吧
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.29,0:07:05.31,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,原因或許是晚上穿和服掉海裡了?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.79,0:07:06.68,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,有道理
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.96,0:07:13.52,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.10,0:07:14.91,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.45,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你穿著的和服  要怎麼脫下來
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.52,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.83,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,為什麼要問這個
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.83,0:07:25.38,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不清楚到了關鍵時候  能不能順利脫下來
Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.82,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,關鍵時候…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.44,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你  你是笨蛋嗎!?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.00,0:07:34.64,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,契  契約 又不是這樣的…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.29,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,脫不下來的話  真溺水了不就麻煩了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.29,0:07:37.78,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.29,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.81,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,穿著這個東西  就算是河童也游不了吧
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.20,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.56,0:07:48.07,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,難道不是河馬?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.72,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,抱  抱歉
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我並不是想要笑話你
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.12,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,只是想開個小玩笑…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.00,0:08:04.46,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不過也是  穿和服游不了泳
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.65,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.12,0:08:09.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,良一他們這麼一說  我就在思考對策了
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.24,0:08:12.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯  我也想一想
Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.91,0:08:14.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.14,0:08:15.64,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.26,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.89,0:08:20.66,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一直在幫我想辦法
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.14,0:08:25.68,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.58,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,終於要到明天了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.58,0:08:35.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,您好  這裡是加藤家
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,啊  野美希?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.82,0:08:41.45,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸？白羽不見了!?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,祭典前一晚  巫女要待在神社裡的吧
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.35,0:08:48.35,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我不清楚…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.35,0:08:51.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,現在讓蒼去假扮頂替著了
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.52,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,良一和天善現在正在找白羽
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.47,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.17,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那我也去找找
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.72,0:09:00.72,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒事  至於會在哪  我大概有頭緒了
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,大家都在擔心你
Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.35,0:09:15.43,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,至少說一聲吧
Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.26,0:09:17.04,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.82,0:09:20.64,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但我無論如何都想來這裡一趟
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.15,0:09:27.00,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,離夏鳥之儀的時間越近  看見的景象就越清晰
Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,到現在  已經能看清羽依里的臉了
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.44,0:09:35.98,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,為什麼要向我打招呼
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.30,0:09:40.38,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,還帶我去了很多地方
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.18,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,讓我獨自一人就好了
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.31,0:09:46.82,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,即便我消失了也沒事
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.82,0:09:51.57,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但是… 我受不了  再有重要的人離開我了
Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.01,0:10:00.73,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,即便如此  我還是覺得能遇見白羽真的太好了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.14,0:10:06.00,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,正因為有白羽在  我才能從黑暗中游出來
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,所以啊  別說那種話了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,大家也是一樣的
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.91,0:10:14.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一定接受不了白羽消失的
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.93,0:10:20.68,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.18,0:10:21.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.10,0:10:25.81,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但對不起
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.61,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我們回去吧
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.61,0:10:33.75,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.39,0:10:36.83,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,馬上要來了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.83,0:10:38.04,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,想讓你看看
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.36,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,看什麼…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.28,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}螢火蟲
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}海螢
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}海螢…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.35,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}海裡的螢火蟲
Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.64,0:11:02.76,Text CN - Shiroha,,888,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}這個地方  以前爸爸告訴我的秘密的地方
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.13,0:11:05.56,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}已經很久沒發光了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.56,0:11:09.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}但在今年夏天  再次發光了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.77,0:11:10.85,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}時隔十年
Dialogue: 5,0:11:10.85,0:11:11.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}十年!?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.56,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}那我的運氣還真好啊
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.46,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}那個
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}我曾有過 想去未來的想法
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}去未來?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.70,0:11:29.09,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}大概是我等累了吧
Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.09,0:11:32.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}所以想讓時間過得快點  去見到那個人
Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.34,0:11:36.54,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}正因如此  才會變得能看見未來吧
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.76,0:11:39.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}現在也想去嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.37,0:11:41.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}不了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.55,0:11:45.42,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}我不清楚還要等多久
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.52,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}所以  已經夠了
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}這樣啊
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.12,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.90,0:12:13.90,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.64,0:12:33.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,替我向新娘問好
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.51,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那我出發了
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.97,0:12:48.16,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這條路也是走習慣了啊
Dialogue: 5,0:12:51.48,0:12:52.67,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,剛剛那是…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,彩色的… 蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.82,0:13:17.65,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小海?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.51,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,哥  哥哥?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.51,0:13:22.44,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你怎麼會來這裡?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那個  我追著蝴蝶過來的
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.08,0:13:25.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.82,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小海才是  為什麼在這裡?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.43,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,隨便散散步
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.43,0:13:31.53,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.79,0:13:32.58,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.47,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一起走吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.47,0:13:35.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.10,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我還想再稍微散散步
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.17,0:13:45.90,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你跑哪裡去了  馬上到時間了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.52,0:13:49.18,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,抱歉  剛剛見到個熟人
Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,總之快去換衣服
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.50,0:13:54.12,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不先舉行蝶番契約  夏鳥之儀開始不了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.92,0:14:07.28,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,蝶番契約  現在正式開始
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.48,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一二  推
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.89,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一二  推
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.32,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這艘船去年也扛過
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.32,0:15:01.22,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但今年是不是更重了
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.22,0:15:03.75,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,承載的願望越多越重吧
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.25,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.75,0:15:09.04,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,看來什麼都沒有發生呢
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.04,0:15:10.33,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.94,0:15:15.64,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,下雨了?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.03,0:15:18.41,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,幸好在下雨前就結束了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.41,0:15:22.27,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我們也回去吧  就是有點可惜沒能目送到結束
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.07,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.05,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你看見小堀田了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.61,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒看到她
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.45,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,她爸爸到處都找不到她
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.45,0:15:34.57,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,野美希準備用廣播找人
Dialogue: 5,0:15:34.57,0:15:37.18,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,找到了的話  把她帶過來
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里…!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.21,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我看見的未來裡…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.21,0:15:45.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,是我和白羽掉入海裡的未來嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.15,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但是已經…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.25,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,剛剛看得更清楚了
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,440)}一直以為那個人是羽依里  但結果是個女孩
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.86,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,難道是小堀田?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.61,0:15:57.12,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但她為什麼會在海裡
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.18,0:16:00.93,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那艘船!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,難道她在船上?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,真在的話  要把她帶回來才行
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.97,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但要怎麼帶
Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,喂！跟我來
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.86,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小堀田  你在哪
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,擅自把老爸的船開走  待會肯定要揍我
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,你一定要平安無事啊
Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.29,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,看到了！在那邊!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.19,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,交給我吧!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,小堀田!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.74,0:16:28.29,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,大  大哥哥?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.11,0:16:29.92,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.92,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我以為能見到媽媽…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.94,0:16:37.88,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,以為只要坐上這艘船  就能和媽媽相聚了…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.88,0:16:38.85,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.13,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,快把手給我!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.22,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,快過來
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.10,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.37,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.04,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.01,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,良一  這孩子拜託你了
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.00,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.41,0:17:14.38,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.72,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一定要抓住啊!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽…?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.23,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不  不對…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.96,0:17:37.64,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,我們是時之編織者
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.43,0:17:42.22,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,異邦的少年  無論你怎麼追求終將無用功
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.22,0:17:45.67,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,即便在這個夏天相遇
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.11,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,但也僅此而已
Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.66,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,我們只會繼續編織下去…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.74,0:17:56.86,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在哪邊
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.86,0:17:57.76,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,要往哪游
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.41,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.02,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.63,0:18:15.51,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.78,0:18:50.42,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.04,0:18:51.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.07,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,您辛苦了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.37,0:18:56.52,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.32,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,您也辛苦了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.92,0:19:22.66,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我有一件事一直想對白羽說
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.89,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,其實我在初次見面時
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.10,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.35,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,就注意到你是穿著內衣在泳池裡的
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.32,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一直沒跟你說  真的對不起
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.87,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,為什麼要現在說出來啊!?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不  這個… 因為發生了很多事嘛
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這種時候也不知道該說什麼比較好
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.96,0:19:58.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,就 就 就 就算不知道說什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.40,0:20:01.26,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,也不應該提那件事吧!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.08,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,也是啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.89,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我真是太煩色特了了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我在想
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.20,0:20:15.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,未來就像那時的大海般漆黑
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.60,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,一般來說什麼也看不見的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.30,0:20:24.15,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,但在那時  在黑暗中射下一束光
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.91,0:20:28.49,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我認為那便是白羽的能力
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.62,0:20:33.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那個真的很厲害呢
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.94,0:20:36.40,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.78,0:20:37.32,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.59,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  白羽
Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒 沒 沒什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.62,0:20:41.57,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.35,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,只是剛剛看見了一點點
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,看到了什麼？又是不好的事嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.79,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,沒  沒什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.79,0:20:52.14,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,也不完全是不好的事…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.36,0:21:09.44,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.72,0:21:10.35,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.21,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我想起來了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.31,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,想起了什麼?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.24,0:21:15.83,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,度過暑假的方法
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.25,0:21:21.05,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,不知從何時起忘記了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,十分單純且簡單的事
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.08,0:21:28.34,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我啊  最喜歡夏天了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.78,0:21:30.37,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,羽依…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.97,Text CN Top - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,本船即將出港
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.97,0:21:34.56,Text CN Top - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,請各位乘客盡快登船
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.24,0:21:42.80,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,在走之前  還想對你說兩件事
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.16,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,這次又要說什麼
Dialogue: 5,0:21:46.04,0:21:46.88,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.66,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,雖然才一個月  但過得很開心
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.66,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我也是  過得很開心
Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.57,0:22:01.98,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,然後就是…
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.02,0:22:04.70,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我喜歡上你了
Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.46,0:22:12.96,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.60,0:22:29.24,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.48,0:22:36.58,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.83,0:22:40.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我也是——!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.78,0:22:42.06,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我也——!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.57,0:22:44.84,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,喜歡上你了——!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:47.26,0:22:48.88,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我會再來這座島的…
Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.67,0:22:52.56,Text CN Top - Shiroha,,555,0,0,,本船因機械故障  即將返航
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.00,0:22:53.62,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.25,0:22:54.74,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.51,0:22:57.44,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,怎麼又回來了!?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.63,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.84,0:23:06.92,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 5,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.28,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,下次  一定要…
Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.24,0:23:31.03,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,下次?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.55,0:23:33.16,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,下次… 是什麼?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.28,0:23:35.68,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 5,0:23:36.64,0:23:37.60,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,是什麼?
Comment: 4,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文JP  OP後————————
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,1222,0,0,,やれるだけのことをやろう
Comment: 4,0:02:13.48,0:02:15.48,Sign,1,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs80\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.74,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ダメなのか…
Dialogue: 4,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.41,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺はまた…
Comment: 4,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.87,Sign,1,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs80\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}
Comment: 4,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.19,Sign,1,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs84\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}
Comment: 4,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.88,Sign,1,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn方正兰亭圆GBK Medium\fs84\blur0.8\bord0\c&HFDFFFF&\pos(960,875)}
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.38,0:02:38.72,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里　頑張れ～っ！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.51,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは！
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんとっ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.52,0:02:57.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,場外…!?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,勝った…
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里の勝ちだ～っ！！
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.51,0:03:24.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,10年前の夏　しろはは父と母を失った…
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.64,0:03:28.27,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それ以来　引っ込み思案になり
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,友達もなく　よくないうわさをたてられ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.12,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,1人で夏を過ごしてきたが…
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはを頼む
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.88,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,おじいちゃん
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.91,0:03:41.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.47,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夏鳥の儀の間　ずっとしろはのそばで
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.47,0:03:46.82,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはを守ります
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そうすればくだらないうわさだってなくなります
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.22,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.79,0:03:58.89,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それだがな
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.33,0:04:04.34,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夏鳥の儀の巫女の付き添いは　肉親に限られている
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.36,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,肉親？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,え～っ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.06,0:04:14.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ダ　ダ　ダ…　ダメだよそんなの
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.06,0:04:18.15,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里と　ふ　ふ　夫婦だなんて…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.28,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,無論　儀礼的なかりそめのものだ
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.49,0:04:28.32,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺は　しろはに感謝しているんです
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,感謝？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.14,0:04:33.25,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だから　しろはに危険が迫ってるなら
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.94,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いちばん近くで助けたい
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.08,0:04:39.90,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,もし…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.28,0:04:40.78,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.04,0:04:43.78,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,迷惑じゃないなら…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.40,0:04:44.90,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.73,0:04:47.34,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お願いします
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.35,0:04:54.16,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夫婦になってください
Dialogue: 4,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,すご～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お姉ちゃんとお兄ちゃんが結婚！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.31,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,まねごとだよ
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.31,0:05:08.75,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,蝶番の契りとか　いろいろな準備で忙しくなるから
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.45,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,蔵の整理のことは気にしないで
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.64,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しっかりね
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.28,0:05:14.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.34,0:05:17.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,フフッ
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.01,0:05:18.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夫婦
Dialogue: 4,0:05:30.45,0:05:34.69,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お祭り当日は　これに明かりをつけて海に流すから
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.69,0:05:36.77,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,忘れずに持ってくるように
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,1200,0,0,,はい～
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.17,0:05:42.44,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,333,0,,そうか　しろはが海で見た赤い光って　灯籠だったのか
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.11,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なぁ　蒼
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.03,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何？
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.03,0:05:47.85,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あの子…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.85,0:05:50.82,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あっ…　あの子 堀田ちゃんっていうの
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.54,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,去年の冬　お母さんが病気で…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.17,0:06:00.98,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,堀田ちゃん
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.78,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お盆って何か知ってるかい？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,知らない…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お盆の間にだけはね　死んだ人が帰ってくるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.01,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,死んだ人が帰ってくる？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.54,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.73,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,姿は見えないんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.16,0:06:27.79,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それでさ　夏鳥の儀の夜に　海を渡って帰っていくんだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.52,0:06:30.18,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,真っ暗だと怖いだろ？
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.89,0:06:32.81,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,怖い…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.59,0:06:37.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だから　この灯籠で明るくしてあげないとな
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.90,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,安心して帰れるように
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.08,0:06:47.68,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.58,0:06:53.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,確か　今日は衣装合わせだったよな
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.62,0:06:54.59,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あぁ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはがやってる頃だ
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ふむ…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.40,0:07:02.29,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはの予知だと　祭りの日に鷹原たちは溺れるんだろ
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.29,0:07:05.31,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夜の海で着物というのが原因じゃないのか？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.79,0:07:06.68,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なるほど
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.96,0:07:13.52,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.10,0:07:14.91,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.45,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,その着物なんだが　どうやって脱がせたらいいんだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.52,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.83,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんでそんなこと聞く？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.83,0:07:25.38,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いざって時　うまく脱がせられるかわからなくて
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.82,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いざって…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.44,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,バ　バカじゃないの!?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.00,0:07:34.64,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ち　契りってそういう意味では…！
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.29,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,脱げないと溺れたときに困るだろ
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.29,0:07:37.78,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.29,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あぁ
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.81,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そんなもの着ていたら　カッパだって泳げない
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.20,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なるほど
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.56,0:07:48.07,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,カバじゃなくて？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.72,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ご　ごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.60,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,からかうつもりでは
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.12,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ちょっとしたジョークというか…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.00,0:08:04.46,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,でも　確かに着物着てたら泳げない
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.65,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だろ？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.12,0:08:09.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,良一たちに言われてさ　俺も考えなくちゃって
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.24,0:08:12.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,んっ　私も考えておく
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.91,0:08:14.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.14,0:08:15.64,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.26,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ありがとう
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.89,0:08:20.66,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,考えてくれていろいろ
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.14,0:08:25.68,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.58,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いよいよ明日か
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.58,0:08:35.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,はい　加藤です
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あぁ　のみき？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.82,0:08:41.45,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ？　しろはが!?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どういうことだ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,祭りの前日　巫女はお堂にこもるはずだろ？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.35,0:08:48.35,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,わからん…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.35,0:08:51.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だがとりあえず今は　蒼がしろはになりすまし
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.52,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,良一と天善がしろはを捜している
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.47,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,わかった
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.17,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なら俺も捜すよ
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.72,0:09:00.72,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なに　なんとなく心当たりがあるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.60,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,みんな心配してる
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.35,0:09:15.43,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,せめて誰かに伝えてけよ
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.26,0:09:17.04,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.82,0:09:20.64,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,でも　どうしてもここに来たかったから
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.15,0:09:27.00,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夏鳥の儀が近づくにつれて　どんどん鮮明になっていくの
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,今はもう　羽依里の顔もはっきりわかる…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.44,0:09:35.98,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんで声をかけたの？
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.30,0:09:40.38,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それで　いろんなところに誘ってくれて…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.18,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,1人ならよかった
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.31,0:09:46.82,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,私がいなくなるのはいいの…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.82,0:09:51.57,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,でも　また誰か　大事な人がいなくなるのは耐えられない…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.01,0:10:00.73,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それでも俺は　しろはに会えてよかった
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.14,0:10:06.00,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはがいてくれて　俺は救われたんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だから　そんなこと言うなよ…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,きっとみんなそうだ
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.91,0:10:14.34,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろはがいなくなるなんて耐えられない…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.93,0:10:20.68,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.18,0:10:21.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何が？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,わからないけど…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.10,0:10:25.81,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.61,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そろそろ戻ろう
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.61,0:10:33.75,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,待って
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.39,0:10:36.83,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,もうすぐだから
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.83,0:10:38.04,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,見てもらいたい
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.36,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,見るって何を…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.28,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}蛍
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}ウミホタル
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}ウミホタル…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.35,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}海の蛍
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.64,0:11:02.76,Text JP - Shiroha,1,888,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}この場所は昔　お父さんに教えてもらった秘密の場所
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.13,0:11:05.56,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}ずっと光らなくなってた
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.56,0:11:09.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}けど　今年の夏…　また光ったの
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.77,0:11:10.85,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}10年ぶりに
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.85,0:11:11.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}10年!?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.56,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}俺　運がいいんだな
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.46,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}あのね
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}昔　未来に行きたいって思ったことがある
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}未来に？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.70,0:11:29.09,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}たぶん　待つのに疲れたから
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.09,0:11:32.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}時間を早送りして　会いに行きたいって思った
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.34,0:11:36.54,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}だから　見えるようになったのかな…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.76,0:11:39.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}今も行きたい？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.37,0:11:41.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}ううん
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.55,0:11:45.42,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}いつまで待ったらいいかわからないし
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.52,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}だから　もういい
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.60,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\blur3\3c&HEBA21C&}そっか…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.12,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,おかえり
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.90,0:12:13.90,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ただいま
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.64,0:12:33.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,花嫁さんによろしく
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.51,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いってきます
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.97,0:12:48.16,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,この道もすっかり慣れたな…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.48,0:12:52.67,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,今のは…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,虹色の…　蝶？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.82,0:13:17.65,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うみちゃん？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.51,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お　お兄ちゃん？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.51,0:13:22.44,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どうしてここにいるの？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いや　蝶を追いかけて…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.08,0:13:25.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.82,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うみちゃんこそ　どうしてここに？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.43,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ちょっと お散歩
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.43,0:13:31.53,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そっか
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.79,0:13:32.58,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっと…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.47,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,一緒に行こうか？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.47,0:13:35.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ううん…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.10,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,もうちょっとお散歩したいから…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.17,0:13:45.90,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何してたの？　もう時間ギリギリよ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.52,0:13:49.18,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,悪い…　知り合いを見かけてさ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,とにかく急げ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.50,0:13:54.12,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,蝶番の契りを済まさねば　夏鳥の儀が始められん
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,わかった
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.92,0:14:07.28,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,これより　蝶番の契りを執り行う
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.48,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そ～れ
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.89,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そ～れ
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.32,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あの舟　去年も担いだけど
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.32,0:15:01.22,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いっそう重くなってないか？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.22,0:15:03.75,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,願いの数だけ重みを増すんだろう
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.25,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,よっ！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.75,0:15:09.04,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何も起きなかったみてえだな
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.04,0:15:10.33,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,よかったな！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.94,0:15:15.64,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,雨？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.03,0:15:18.41,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,降り出す前に終わってよかったな
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.41,0:15:22.27,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,最後まで見送れないのは残念だが　俺たちも戻ろうか
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そうだな…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.07,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.05,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,堀田ちゃん見なかった？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.61,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いや　見てないが
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.45,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どこにもいないって…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.45,0:15:34.57,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,のみきも放送で呼びかけるみたい
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.57,0:15:37.18,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,もし見つけたら　捕まえといて！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里…！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.21,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,私が見た未来のこと…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.21,0:15:45.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺としろはが海の中ってやつだろ？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.15,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,でもそれはもう…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.25,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,今　はっきり見えたの…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,440)}羽依里だと思っていたもう1人は　女の子だった…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.86,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それが堀田ちゃん？
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.61,0:15:57.12,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,けど　なんで海に…!?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.18,0:16:00.93,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,舟！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.34,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あそこに堀田ちゃんが？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だったら連れ戻さないと！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.97,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,でも　どうやって…？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,おい！　こっちだ！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.86,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どこだ？　堀田ちゃん！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,勝手に舟を出してあとでおやじに殴られるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どうか無事でいてくれよ…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.29,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あっ！　あそこだ！！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.19,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,任せろ！！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,堀田ちゃん！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.74,0:16:28.29,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お　お兄さん…？
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.11,0:16:29.92,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,よかった…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.92,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,私　お母さんに会えると思って…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:33.94,0:16:37.88,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,この舟に乗れば　同じところに行けるかもって…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.88,0:16:38.85,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ごめんなさい…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.13,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,こっちに手を伸ばして！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.22,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,さっ　こっち…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.10,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.37,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.04,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.01,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,良一　この子を頼む！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.00,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.41,0:17:14.38,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.72,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,届け～っ！！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは…？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.23,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いや　違う…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.96,0:17:37.64,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,私たちは時の編み人
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.43,0:17:42.22,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,異邦の少年　いくら求めても無理だよ
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.22,0:17:45.67,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,たとえ　この夏に巡り会えたとしても
Dialogue: 4,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.11,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,それだけのこと…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.66,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,私たちはただ編み続ける…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:55.74,0:17:56.86,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どっちだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.86,0:17:57.76,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どっちに行けば？
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.41,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あれは…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.02,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,こっち…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:14.63,0:18:15.51,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,こっち…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.78,0:18:50.42,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,よっ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.04,0:18:51.60,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.07,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お疲れさまでした
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.37,0:18:56.52,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いえ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.32,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,お互いにお疲れさまでした
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.92,0:19:22.66,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺　しろはにずっと言いたかったことがあるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.89,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,実は俺　初めて会ったときから…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.10,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.35,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,プールに下着で入ってたこと　気付いていました
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.32,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ずっと黙っててごめん
Dialogue: 4,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.87,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なぜ今になって言う!?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いや　なんかいろいろありすぎて いっぱいいっぱいでさぁ
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,こんなとき何て言えばいいのか わからなくなって…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.96,0:19:58.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,だだだ…　だからって
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.40,0:20:01.26,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それを選ぶことはないんじゃないかと思う！
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.08,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そうだよね…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.89,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ホントどすこいだよ俺
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺　思ったんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:12.20,0:20:15.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,未来って　あのときの海みたいに真っ暗で
Dialogue: 4,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.60,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,普通　何も見えるはずがないけど…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.30,0:20:24.15,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,そこに一筋の光を投げかけるような…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:25.91,0:20:28.49,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それがしろはの力なんだと思う
Dialogue: 4,0:20:30.62,0:20:33.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それって　すごいことだよな
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.94,0:20:36.40,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あっ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.78,0:20:37.32,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.59,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どうした？　しろは
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,な　な　なんでもない
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.62,0:20:41.57,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんでも
Dialogue: 4,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.35,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ちらっと見えただけだから
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何が？　また不吉なものなのか？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.79,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんでもないし
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.79,0:20:52.14,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,全然不吉じゃなかったけど…
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.36,0:21:09.44,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,どうしたの？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:09.72,0:21:10.35,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.21,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,思い出した
Dialogue: 4,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.31,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,何を？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:14.24,0:21:15.83,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,夏休みの過ごし方
Dialogue: 4,0:21:18.25,0:21:21.05,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,いつの間忘れていたんだろうな…
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,とても単純で簡単なことなのに
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.08,0:21:28.34,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺は　夏が大好きだったってこと
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.78,0:21:30.37,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,羽依…
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.97,Text JP Top - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,まもなく出航します
Dialogue: 4,0:21:31.97,0:21:34.56,Text JP Top - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,皆様　乗船を済ませてください
Dialogue: 4,0:21:39.24,0:21:42.80,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,最後にさ　言いたいことが2つあるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.16,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,今度は何？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.04,0:21:46.88,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.66,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,一時だけど　楽しかった
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.66,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,私も　楽しかった
Dialogue: 4,0:22:00.57,0:22:01.98,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,それで　俺…
Dialogue: 4,0:22:03.02,0:22:04.70,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,君を好きになりました
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.46,0:22:12.96,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.60,0:22:29.24,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,しろは？
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.48,0:22:36.58,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なに～!?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.83,0:22:40.50,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,私も～！
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.78,0:22:42.06,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,あなたを！
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.57,0:22:44.84,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,好きになりました～！
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.26,0:22:48.88,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,俺またこの島に…
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.67,0:22:52.56,Text JP Top - Shiroha,1,555,0,0,,当船は機器の不具合のため　引き返します
Dialogue: 4,0:22:53.00,0:22:53.62,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.25,0:22:54.74,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.51,0:22:57.44,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,なんで戻ってくるの!?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.63,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,ただいま
Dialogue: 4,0:23:05.84,0:23:06.92,Text JP - Shiroha,1,0,0,0,,おかえり
Dialogue: 4,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.28,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,きっと　次は…
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.24,0:23:31.03,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,次？
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.55,0:23:33.16,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,次って何？
Dialogue: 4,0:23:34.28,0:23:35.68,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,私って…
Dialogue: 4,0:23:36.64,0:23:37.60,Text JP - Umi,1,0,0,0,,何？
